			(property "Description" "Ferrite Bead (blocks, cores, rings, chokes, etc.)\n\nInductor with layers of ferrite used to suppress high frequencies. Often used to isolate high frequency noise.\n\nSparkFun Products:\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13613 IOIO-OTG - V2.2\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13664 SparkFun SAMD21 Mini Breakout\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13339 SparkFun 6 Degrees of Freedom Breakout - LSM6DS3\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/13672 SparkFun SAMD21 Dev Breakout\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/11013 Lilypad MP3"
